# Trivy misconfiguration suppressions for this repo.
# Each entry is intentional and documented; revisit if the module changes.

# AVD-AWS-0104 — Security group rule allows unrestricted egress (0.0.0.0/0).
# The RDS security groups restrict INGRESS to the VPC CIDR blocks; egress is left
# open on purpose (standard outbound for the managed instance). Consumers can
# tighten egress when required — kept flexible by design.
AVD-AWS-0104
